Package: PISTE
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Pathway Inference with INLA
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("PISTE research contributors", role = "aut"),
    person("Research handoff maintainer", role = "cre",
           email = "maintainer@example.org"))
Description: Fits spatial pathway models with a shared baseline intercept,
    relative regional effects, conditionally independent regional gene
    effects and replicated gene-specific spatial fields. The observed mode
    models normalised expression as Gaussian; the adjusted mode models raw
    counts as negative binomial with a cell-type composition offset, so that
    regional differences are adjusted for composition. Computes directional
    pathway probabilities and posterior evidence using compact CCD
    configuration mixtures. Includes a command-line interface that runs
    every gene set of a GMT file.
